WEBVTT

00:00:21.796 --> 00:00:24.566
Let's go and don't cry, funny

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:27.502
Give me a dumbass dream, please

00:00:27.502 --> 00:00:29.738
Don't touch me, baby

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:32.941
Freedom, baby

00:00:32.941 --> 00:00:38.847
I'm elastic, I want to be chained

00:00:38.847 --> 00:00:43.451
Can you feel it? The nonsensical afterimage

00:00:43.451 --> 00:00:55.196
Even the moments of points and lines
disappear after failing to show

00:00:55.196 --> 00:01:00.936
The sad forefront, an empty sensation

00:01:00.936 --> 00:01:06.608
Sweet remnants that tear at my heart

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:12.280
Scattering Polaroids, gathering paranoia

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:17.452
I want you to tell me whose turn is next

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:30.729
If you sleep close to this incomplete
form, you'll understand and see

00:01:35.737 --> 00:01:39.074
Tissue fragments and the motorcycle
remains have been recovered

00:01:39.074 --> 00:01:42.344
from the spot where Gerd
Frentzen fell and exploded,

00:01:42.344 --> 00:01:45.180
but we were unable to find his body.

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:49.918
I believe he was sent flying in
the explosion and sunk into the water.

00:01:49.918 --> 00:01:52.120
And the contactees?

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:55.123
Just to be safe, the man
and woman who were attacked

00:01:55.123 --> 00:01:59.227
are under 48-hour quarantine
observation in the Research Department.

00:01:59.227 --> 00:02:04.232
If we can at least determine
the manner in which a live person

00:02:04.232 --> 00:02:08.570
like Gerd Frentzen becomes an
Amalgam after an Amalgam attack,

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:10.905
there's a chance we can still stop it.

00:02:10.905 --> 00:02:15.477
I've made it the research team's top priority.

00:02:15.477 --> 00:02:21.249
For Hermann Saltza's punishment,
I give him three days suspension.

00:02:21.249 --> 00:02:22.584
That is all.

00:02:22.584 --> 00:02:25.720
Wait! I'm also responsible for Gerd's...!

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:28.690
This has nothing to do with you. I did it.

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:33.428
Yes, it's punishment for taking
Gerd to an Amalgam removal site,

00:02:33.428 --> 00:02:38.033
giving him a motorcycle,
and ultimately letting him escape.

00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:41.102
Normally, a week of solitary
confinement would be considered light.

00:02:41.102 --> 00:02:46.908
I regret nothing. Even now, I still trust Gerd.

00:02:46.908 --> 00:02:49.377
Hermann! Go home and cool off!

00:02:49.377 --> 00:02:51.746
Understood, sir.

00:02:51.746 --> 00:02:55.216
I can understand how he feels, though.

00:02:55.216 --> 00:02:59.587
The media is basically treating
him like an Amalgam now.

00:02:59.587 --> 00:03:02.490
Squad 1 will follow up on the Gerd incident.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:07.729
Squad 2 will track the other one
Hermann and Amanda encountered.

00:03:07.729 --> 00:03:10.532
You say it's the same one from the racetrack?

00:03:10.532 --> 00:03:12.898
Yes. There's no doubt about it.

00:03:16.004 --> 00:03:18.873
For convenience's sake, we'll call him Blue.

00:03:18.873 --> 00:03:23.745
Blue, just like Gerd, may
be taking on a human form.

00:03:23.745 --> 00:03:27.549
Al's team will question the local
authorities to ascertain the situation.

00:03:27.549 --> 00:03:32.320
Amanda and Mei-Fong will check
the combat and surveillance videos.

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:33.981
Understood!

00:03:41.629 --> 00:03:43.290
Gerd...

00:03:46.134 --> 00:03:49.971
Come on! How long are you
going to keep me locked up in here?!

00:03:49.971 --> 00:03:55.034
Just let me go already! I'm the victim here!

00:03:59.681 --> 00:04:02.584
It's been 36 hours. How are their tests?

00:04:02.584 --> 00:04:04.452
There've been no apparent changes.

00:04:04.452 --> 00:04:07.489
I see. Continue to
watch them for 12 more hours.

00:04:07.489 --> 00:04:09.858
Understood.

00:04:09.858 --> 00:04:13.589
So he's finally made a move...

00:04:17.132 --> 00:04:19.901
Hey, it's been three hours! Get up!

00:04:19.901 --> 00:04:22.270
- Ten more minutes...
- Come on!

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:25.640
Fine, five minutes...

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.542
I made some coffee.

00:04:27.542 --> 00:04:28.676
Thanks.

00:04:28.676 --> 00:04:32.580
Isn't that video from when Gerd left here?

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.717
How is it related to the blue Amalgam?

00:04:35.717 --> 00:04:39.687
It's not, but according to Hermann's report,

00:04:39.687 --> 00:04:43.024
there was a moment
here when he acted strangely.

00:04:43.024 --> 00:04:44.225
Oh?

00:04:44.225 --> 00:04:46.794
So I thought I'd take a look.

00:04:46.794 --> 00:04:50.231
This man... He was here too?

00:04:50.231 --> 00:04:53.166
Do you honestly think you saved him?

00:04:56.971 --> 00:05:02.443
It has me curious. He doesn't
keep showing up out of coincidence.

00:05:02.443 --> 00:05:05.547
There's something to this man...

00:05:05.547 --> 00:05:09.313
Oh! Isn't that Malek-kun?

00:05:10.518 --> 00:05:12.520
Malek...

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:15.614
Wasn't there school that day?

00:05:17.759 --> 00:05:20.328
- Lend me that game sometime, Malek.
- Here he comes!

00:05:20.328 --> 00:05:26.467
Malek! You're not fit to come to school!

00:05:26.467 --> 00:05:30.205
Demoniacs come here from
your country! I bet you're one, too!

00:05:30.205 --> 00:05:32.407
I'll put the mark on you!

00:05:32.407 --> 00:05:33.675
Stop!

00:05:33.675 --> 00:05:35.944
- Let go!
- Hold still!

00:05:35.944 --> 00:05:40.415
God is watching, you know!
Don't you feel ashamed?!

00:05:40.415 --> 00:05:43.646
Someone possessed by
a demon, talking about God!

00:05:47.755 --> 00:05:50.425
W-What do you want?

00:05:50.425 --> 00:05:52.086
Get lost!

00:05:56.497 --> 00:05:59.728
Malek! You better not ever come to school!

00:06:21.556 --> 00:06:24.392
The hero we had hopes for was an illusion.

00:06:24.392 --> 00:06:28.196
- Gerd Frentzen is another demon.
- I'm home!

00:06:28.196 --> 00:06:30.932
Malek. I need to talk to you.

00:06:30.932 --> 00:06:35.403
You secretly skipped
school two days ago, didn't you?

00:06:35.403 --> 00:06:37.872
You came to the XAT headquarters, didn't you?

00:06:37.872 --> 00:06:39.207
Why?

00:06:39.207 --> 00:06:43.211
You promised the counselor
the other day that you'd consult us

00:06:43.211 --> 00:06:47.215
when you want a break.

00:06:47.215 --> 00:06:49.617
Did you come to see me?

00:06:49.617 --> 00:06:52.353
I wanted to see the champ.

00:06:52.353 --> 00:06:56.090
As a fan, I have to support
him at a time like this.

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:57.425
For Gerd?

00:06:57.425 --> 00:07:00.895
Yeah. Give it to him when you see him next.

00:07:00.895 --> 00:07:03.031
O-Okay.

00:07:03.031 --> 00:07:08.526
I don't believe what they say
on TV. Gerd is a hero. Isn't he?

00:07:13.875 --> 00:07:15.536
Wait, Malek!

00:07:19.714 --> 00:07:24.252
Tell me, Malek. Did
something happen at school?

00:07:24.252 --> 00:07:27.021
Malek! How did you hurt your hand?

00:07:27.021 --> 00:07:30.286
I fell. Don't worry.

00:07:33.127 --> 00:07:35.063
This is Amanda.

00:07:35.063 --> 00:07:36.864
Sorry to call so late.

00:07:36.864 --> 00:07:40.134
The condition of the man Gerd
attacked has suddenly changed.

00:07:40.134 --> 00:07:42.570
Can you head to the research lab right away?

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:43.871
Understood.

00:07:43.871 --> 00:07:48.365
Malek. I have to leave
for work. Hold down the fort.

00:08:04.459 --> 00:08:05.760
I take it he'll fall.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:08.463
He's lower grade than the one before.

00:08:08.463 --> 00:08:12.229
He'll fall fast, too. He's so unbeautiful.

00:08:19.374 --> 00:08:22.104
Jil invited me here!

00:08:24.545 --> 00:08:28.616
I'm sorry! It was wrong of me, Gerd!

00:08:28.616 --> 00:08:30.017
S-Stop!

00:08:30.017 --> 00:08:32.253
Is he going to change into an Amalgam?

00:08:32.253 --> 00:08:33.721
I'm not sure yet.

00:08:33.721 --> 00:08:37.325
But it seems to be more of
a hallucination than a nightmare.

00:08:37.325 --> 00:08:38.559
Hallucination?

00:08:38.559 --> 00:08:41.863
Yes. He's having a bad dream while awake.

00:08:41.863 --> 00:08:45.867
His post-48 hour test
showed no problems at all, but...

00:08:45.867 --> 00:08:46.968
And the woman?

00:08:46.968 --> 00:08:49.303
- Let me out! It's been 48 hours!
- Absolutely no change at all.

00:08:49.303 --> 00:08:54.675
As 48 hours have now passed,
she'll be released sometime tonight.

00:08:54.675 --> 00:08:59.112
- Stop! Stop!
- I want my lawyer!

00:09:00.081 --> 00:09:03.684
Gerd attacked her too, yet...

00:09:03.684 --> 00:09:05.420
The same is true for corpses.

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:09.791
Not everyone killed by Amalgams
wind up as Amalgams themselves.

00:09:09.791 --> 00:09:12.493
What's the difference?

00:09:12.493 --> 00:09:15.630
Amanda-san. It's the captain.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.632
Boss? Amanda here.

00:09:17.632 --> 00:09:20.435
Squad 1 is heading there now.

00:09:20.435 --> 00:09:24.372
As soon as they arrive,
escort Jil Hoffmann to her home.

00:09:24.372 --> 00:09:27.442
I've already sent Al's team to her home.

00:09:27.442 --> 00:09:29.143
Meet up and stake the place out!

00:09:29.143 --> 00:09:30.804
Understood!

00:09:36.984 --> 00:09:40.755
And now for some Demoniac-related news.

00:09:40.755 --> 00:09:43.591
This is Rainer Werner,
at the home of Jil Hoffmann.

00:09:43.591 --> 00:09:46.694
I'd like to ask a few questions.

00:09:46.694 --> 00:09:51.265
Congratulations on being released
from the hospital after your tests.

00:09:51.265 --> 00:09:54.936
Could you tell us what happened
when Gerd Frentzen attacked you?

00:09:54.936 --> 00:09:59.607
I was discussing the future of
the team with the team manager.

00:09:59.607 --> 00:10:03.544
We were also discussing
Gerd, when suddenly he...

00:10:03.544 --> 00:10:08.015
Any idea what caused Gerd to
become a Demoniac while still alive?

00:10:08.015 --> 00:10:14.422
Not really... But he always
had a very jealous and violent side.

00:10:14.422 --> 00:10:16.691
It's not surprising that he'd be possessed...

00:10:16.691 --> 00:10:19.427
- I see.
- Bullshit!

00:10:19.427 --> 00:10:26.634
You were in see-through negligee,
talking to a man in a robe at night!

00:10:26.634 --> 00:10:29.036
Of course Gerd would be pissed!

00:10:29.036 --> 00:10:30.638
That was Jil Hoffmann...

00:10:30.638 --> 00:10:33.341
...the heroine of this tragedy.
- Heroine, my ass!

00:10:33.341 --> 00:10:36.844
Damn it!

00:10:36.844 --> 00:10:42.009
Tomorrow, I'm going over
there and making her confess.

00:10:51.058 --> 00:10:56.063
Nothing happened last night. Can't we just go?

00:10:56.063 --> 00:10:57.598
Captain's orders.

00:10:57.598 --> 00:11:02.870
She'll be fine. The local
authorities can handle the rest.

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:05.640
Do we really need to stake the place out?

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:09.310
We don't know if Gerd is alive or dead yet.

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:10.971
Hide!

00:11:13.781 --> 00:11:15.616
It's Hermann!

00:11:15.616 --> 00:11:17.675
Let's go.

00:11:19.287 --> 00:11:21.289
You! What was that on TV yesterday?!

00:11:21.289 --> 00:11:23.324
Hold on! What is this?!

00:11:23.324 --> 00:11:27.028
- You and your bullshit!
- When did I say anything untrue?!

00:11:27.028 --> 00:11:30.031
Gerd would never attack you for no reason!

00:11:30.031 --> 00:11:31.532
I didn't do anything!

00:11:31.532 --> 00:11:35.736
Liar! Like you were really
"discussing" something dressed like that!

00:11:35.736 --> 00:11:38.639
Gerd has never once resorted to violence!

00:11:38.639 --> 00:11:43.811
You just don't know him! Gerd
is as far from a hero as you can get!

00:11:43.811 --> 00:11:46.847
He always acted possessed from the start!

00:11:46.847 --> 00:11:50.818
It's only natural he became a monster!
Yes! He deserves to be dead!

00:11:50.818 --> 00:11:51.852
Why, you...!

00:11:51.852 --> 00:11:54.689
And now you're being violent!

00:11:54.689 --> 00:11:56.157
Hermann! Stop!

00:11:56.157 --> 00:11:57.725
Amanda! But she...!

00:11:57.725 --> 00:12:00.161
Hermann!

00:12:00.161 --> 00:12:04.999
Geez! Give me a break!
First Gerd attacks me, then XAT?!

00:12:04.999 --> 00:12:08.069
We don't know if Gerd really is dead.

00:12:08.069 --> 00:12:10.738
We haven't found his body, you see!

00:12:10.738 --> 00:12:12.506
What?! But...

00:12:12.506 --> 00:12:16.877
If he is possessed, he might
regenerate and come back for you.

00:12:16.877 --> 00:12:18.412
N-No way...

00:12:18.412 --> 00:12:22.817
But if you really don't feel guilty,
then there's nothing to worry about.

00:12:22.817 --> 00:12:25.786
W-Wait! W-What are you doing?!

00:12:25.786 --> 00:12:29.790
XAT is supposed to
protect citizens from monsters!

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:31.826
Don't leave! Please!

00:12:31.826 --> 00:12:33.327
Why are you guys here?

00:12:33.327 --> 00:12:37.365
If this monster Gerd is alive just like you say,

00:12:37.365 --> 00:12:40.401
the captain says he will come back here.

00:12:40.401 --> 00:12:44.839
Don't worry. We'll be outside.

00:12:44.839 --> 00:12:49.910
Say, aren't you supposed to be
on suspension? What a hard worker.

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:51.445
You're in big trouble if they find out.

00:12:51.445 --> 00:12:54.548
They're short of hands. Nothing to worry about.

00:12:54.548 --> 00:12:58.552
Dammit! Everyone's
treating Gerd like a monster!

00:12:58.552 --> 00:13:01.122
Even after they all heralded him as a hero!

00:13:01.122 --> 00:13:03.824
That's society for ya.

00:13:03.824 --> 00:13:09.897
Even so, there's one other person
besides you who believes in Gerd.

00:13:09.897 --> 00:13:12.566
My little brother wrote a fan letter for Gerd.

00:13:12.566 --> 00:13:16.404
Even after what happened, he's still his hero.

00:13:16.404 --> 00:13:21.909
I see. Malek... I wish
I could've given it to him...

00:13:21.909 --> 00:13:26.614
Sorry, but there's no time to get
all sentimental. Al, get in position.

00:13:26.614 --> 00:13:27.782
Right.

00:13:27.782 --> 00:13:31.252
Hermann, you take
the front. I'll take the inside.

00:13:31.252 --> 00:13:32.651
Right.

00:13:36.457 --> 00:13:38.959
Come on, there's no time left.

00:13:38.959 --> 00:13:41.729
Are you planning not to go, Joseph?

00:13:41.729 --> 00:13:44.932
Answer me!

00:13:44.932 --> 00:13:48.936
There are too many people at the research lab.

00:13:48.936 --> 00:13:52.673
If he does break out, the XAT
will be helpless to do anything.

00:13:52.673 --> 00:13:54.809
He will escape.

00:13:54.809 --> 00:13:57.745
Meaning that'll be your chance.

00:13:57.745 --> 00:14:01.482
Does this mean you've had
enough of crowds, after the racetrack?

00:14:01.482 --> 00:14:03.109
I guess.

00:14:04.952 --> 00:14:07.614
Stay away! Stay away!

00:14:14.895 --> 00:14:17.565
His pulse and heart rate are abnormal!

00:14:17.565 --> 00:14:20.668
He also has a temperature of
44° C! He's becoming an Amalgam!

00:14:20.668 --> 00:14:22.636
Whoa, look!

00:14:25.673 --> 00:14:26.674
You see that?!

00:14:26.674 --> 00:14:29.905
Yes, he assimilated with the doorknob!

00:14:32.179 --> 00:14:35.916
Matthew has escaped from the
research ward! Squad 1 is in pursuit!

00:14:35.916 --> 00:14:38.919
It's highly likely that he's headed your way!

00:14:38.919 --> 00:14:42.156
We're headed for the final line of defense!

00:14:42.156 --> 00:14:46.327
If he breaks through, it'll all
come down to you guys! Take him out!

00:14:46.327 --> 00:14:47.862
Understood!

00:14:47.862 --> 00:14:50.194
What is Squad 1 doing?!

00:15:31.372 --> 00:15:35.910
Matthew and a motorcycle
chasing him are coming this way!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:38.813
I guess he really is headed for Jil's home!

00:15:38.813 --> 00:15:41.048
It's him! It's Blue!

00:15:41.048 --> 00:15:44.552
Alright, let's take 'em both in
one fell swoop! Prepare to attack!

00:15:44.552 --> 00:15:46.213
Roger!

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:02.369
- Now! Fire!
- Roger!

00:16:11.745 --> 00:16:13.314
Hit confirmed!

00:16:13.314 --> 00:16:14.782
Squad 1 has arrived!

00:16:14.782 --> 00:16:19.420
About time! Surround the building
and seize anyone who comes out!

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:20.454
Understood!

00:16:20.454 --> 00:16:24.288
If anyone tries to run, shoot to kill!

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:30.929
He's hurt! Don't let him escape! Finish him off!

00:16:38.272 --> 00:16:40.140
Target obliterated!

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:44.078
Alright! Squad 1, keep
the building surrounded!

00:16:44.078 --> 00:16:47.214
Confirm that Matthew is dead!

00:16:47.214 --> 00:16:51.819
Blue has been decimated at
Point N3! Has fallen into the Elbe River!

00:16:51.819 --> 00:16:55.155
Matthew's condition still
unconfirmed! Search ongoing!

00:16:55.155 --> 00:16:59.493
Squad 2, please continue with the operation!

00:16:59.493 --> 00:17:01.518
Something's coming...

00:17:03.898 --> 00:17:09.598
If he is possessed, he might
regenerate and come back for you.

00:17:10.905 --> 00:17:12.840
No... That's impossible...

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:14.642
Jil!

00:17:14.642 --> 00:17:15.843
It's me...

00:17:15.843 --> 00:17:18.479
Matthew! Don't scare me like that!

00:17:18.479 --> 00:17:20.080
Help me!

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.615
What's wrong?

00:17:21.615 --> 00:17:24.551
I'm... I'm...

00:17:24.551 --> 00:17:27.121
Wait... That's...!

00:17:27.121 --> 00:17:35.629
N-No! I'm not possessed!

00:17:35.629 --> 00:17:38.265
I shot him through the heart
but he fled into the room!

00:17:38.265 --> 00:17:41.302
He's not human anymore! Be careful, Amanda!

00:17:41.302 --> 00:17:43.671
- Freeze!
- Help me... Help me...

00:17:43.671 --> 00:17:46.697
Brad! I'll drive him around front! Get ready!

00:17:51.545 --> 00:17:53.047
Out of ammo?!

00:17:53.047 --> 00:17:55.883
Hermann! Shoot when he comes out!

00:17:55.883 --> 00:17:59.553
Wait! Don't shoot! Please don't shoot!

00:17:59.553 --> 00:18:00.821
Come out slowly.

00:18:00.821 --> 00:18:04.925
Why are you trying to kill me?
I only ran because I was scared!

00:18:04.925 --> 00:18:05.926
Stop!

00:18:05.926 --> 00:18:09.763
Because I look different now?
Because I'm a monster?

00:18:09.763 --> 00:18:12.299
Don't I have rights as a person?!

00:18:12.299 --> 00:18:18.339
Listen! Kneel down slowly
and put both hands on the ground!

00:18:18.339 --> 00:18:20.874
Alright! Now don't move!

00:18:20.874 --> 00:18:22.843
Please, don't kill me!

00:18:22.843 --> 00:18:27.246
I won't if you cooperate! Let's
get you back to the lab for treatment!

00:18:28.449 --> 00:18:32.586
Y-You lie! The instant I look down,
all three of you are gonna shoot!

00:18:32.586 --> 00:18:34.822
We won't! Now calm down!

00:18:34.822 --> 00:18:39.593
Then why do you keep pointing
your guns at me?! I'm not resisting!

00:18:39.593 --> 00:18:46.367
Screw getting killed quietly!
I think I'll kill you three instead!

00:18:46.367 --> 00:18:50.904
No! I'll kill everyone who
treated me like some monster!

00:18:50.904 --> 00:18:52.706
- Shoot, Hermann!
- Stop!

00:18:52.706 --> 00:18:57.678
What are you hesitating for?!

00:18:57.678 --> 00:19:00.948
You're the monster from the racetrack!

00:19:00.948 --> 00:19:02.745
Are you trying to get in the way?!

00:19:05.119 --> 00:19:06.186
That's...!

00:19:06.186 --> 00:19:09.456
Won't you team up with
me to slaughter them all?!

00:19:09.456 --> 00:19:10.457
Are you serious?!

00:19:10.457 --> 00:19:12.760
If we're to be scorned as
monsters for the rest of our lives,

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:16.363
then let's just kill everyone
who discriminates against us!

00:19:16.363 --> 00:19:18.065
You're a monster too!

00:19:18.065 --> 00:19:20.367
I refuse!

00:19:20.367 --> 00:19:25.703
It's all your fault Gerd
wound up being called a monster!

00:19:26.774 --> 00:19:28.208
See?! Even the XAT is shooting at you!

00:19:28.208 --> 00:19:29.505
I said no!

00:19:32.279 --> 00:19:35.305
If you won't team up with me, then die!

00:19:54.868 --> 00:19:56.637
- I won't let you escape!
- Hermann!

00:19:56.637 --> 00:20:01.075
We're out of ammo! Our
mission is to protect Jil Hoffmann!

00:20:01.075 --> 00:20:03.844
Sorry. I got carried away...

00:20:03.844 --> 00:20:07.714
What's the deal? You let one get away?

00:20:07.714 --> 00:20:10.818
Jil Hoffman is safe and unharmed.

00:20:10.818 --> 00:20:13.320
The captain's team is on its way here.

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:16.590
Please send a quarantine
vehicle to Jil's home immediately!

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:19.026
Squad 1, go after Blue!

00:20:19.026 --> 00:20:24.225
He should still be within a 5 km. Radius
of the Point N4 area, east of Jil's home!

00:20:36.477 --> 00:20:41.448
If the XAT's going to be an obstacle,
it'd be beautiful to destroy them.

00:20:41.448 --> 00:20:45.285
Though I doubt you'd ever do that.

00:20:45.285 --> 00:20:48.021
That man...

00:20:48.021 --> 00:20:51.925
There's a chance he can be saved.

00:20:51.925 --> 00:20:56.063
After what happened to you?
You must be crazy, Joseph.

00:20:56.063 --> 00:20:58.632
Do you know where the next will be?

00:20:58.632 --> 00:21:03.203
Yes. But I think you're
going to be a wanted man.

00:21:03.203 --> 00:21:06.306
Do you think you'll make it back home?

00:21:06.306 --> 00:21:09.343
I'll be fine in this form.

00:21:09.343 --> 00:21:14.246
I hope so. Your other form
is way more beautiful, though.

00:21:47.114 --> 00:21:54.988
The ever-flowing songs search my memory

00:21:54.988 --> 00:22:07.100
The pain etched out by the
times slowly brings me back

00:22:07.100 --> 00:22:10.337
Embrace the sadness

00:22:10.337 --> 00:22:17.778
I know, the days that have passed by

00:22:17.778 --> 00:22:22.282
When I look up, it doesn't spill down

00:22:22.282 --> 00:22:28.855
As it trickles down the window,
sad rain rattles the heated isolation

00:22:28.855 --> 00:22:34.228
Tonight I will be forsaken by sleep

00:22:34.228 --> 00:22:42.035
It's almost as if I'm traveling
to a country no one's ever heard of

00:22:42.035 --> 00:22:48.375
I'm all alone, and my words
don't get through to anyone

00:22:48.375 --> 00:22:50.444
Wow wow

00:22:50.444 --> 00:22:58.452
Now my heart is frozen and waiting

00:22:58.452 --> 00:23:05.221
because it wants a phone
call so it can connect with you

00:23:13.734 --> 00:23:16.603
Fear and paranoia continue to grow.

00:23:16.603 --> 00:23:21.775
In pursuit of the man holding
the key, a sealed city heats up.

00:23:21.775 --> 00:23:25.012
Episode 4: "Under Siege."

00:23:25.012 --> 00:23:30.245
To catch the wounded beast,
hunting dogs are now released.
